    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch grasshoppers and collect them all!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grasshopper Collection is a full-fledged grasshopper-catching simulation game where you can enjoy the thrill of not knowing which grasshopper will appear next in this collection-style game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grasshoppers appear in the field, and with just your mouse and keyboard, you can catch them and store them in your Steam inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each grasshopper has its own rarity. Every time you catch one, you\u2019ll receive an item based on the following probabilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common: 90%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare: 4.5%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic: 0.49%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary: 0.01%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect them all and show off your collection on our official Discord!<br>\ud83d\udc49 </p>",
